# PLC Control

This folder contains the PLC control logic for the Mini Automated Sorting Conveyor.

## Current Status

In Development

The project is currently beginning with PLC fundamentals and basic control logic.

## Planned Control Functions

The PLC system will eventually include:

- Start and stop control
- Conveyor motor control
- Object detection
- Sorting sequence
- Timers and counters
- Automatic and manual operating modes
- Safety interlocks
- Fault detection
- Alarm handling
- Fault reset logic

## Planned Topics

During development, this section will document:

- PLC hardware configuration
- I/O addressing
- PLC tags
- Ladder Logic
- Structured Text
- Program structure
- Control sequences
- Interlocks
- Fault handling

PLC programs, screenshots, and explanations will be added as the project progresses.
